{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beach full of bottles. A shore scattered with cans. And maybe, just maybe, a few treasures buried beneath the sand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Mostly Trash, Sometimes Treasure</strong>, a cozy little dig and sort game that is about cleaning the coast, finding small treasures in the sand, and slowly improving the tools that let you dig deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962580/extras/5124896e5299826fdb85d5248b77e32f.poster.avif?t=1756995191\" aria-label=\"Metal detecting on the beach\" width=700 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962580/extras/5124896e5299826fdb85d5248b77e32f.webm?t=1756995191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962580/extras/5124896e5299826fdb85d5248b77e32f.mp4?t=1756995191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple and satisfying loop:</strong><br>Scan. Dig. Sort. Upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trash or treasure?</strong><br>Not every bottle is empty, recycle what doesn\u2019t belong to nature and pocket the valuables you uncover, and slowly fill your collection with rare finds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectibles:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep shells, coins and valuables or sell them to fund your next upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades that matter:</strong><br>Better scanners, sturdier shovels, and faster sifters help you dig deeper and clear more of the coast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy mood and pacing:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No timers, no pressure. Do it on your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962580/extras/029784d22e6fe0d41d4160ff0d3a65a2.poster.avif?t=1756995191\" aria-label=\"Finding a treasure chest\" width=700 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962580/extras/029784d22e6fe0d41d4160ff0d3a65a2.webm?t=1756995191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962580/extras/029784d22e6fe0d41d4160ff0d3a65a2.mp4?t=1756995191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3962580?t=1756995191","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3962580?t=1756995191","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962580/60b2735eea86868bc777a8cd3e274c06df5c9444/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756995191","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962580/60b2735eea86868bc777a8cd3e274c06df5c9444/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756995191","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beach full of bottles. A shore scattered with cans. And maybe, just maybe, a few treasures buried beneath the sand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Mostly Trash, Sometimes Treasure</strong>, a cozy little dig and sort game that is about cleaning the coast, finding small treasures in the sand, and slowly improving the tools that let you dig deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted l